   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each number is the least number of queen moves an amazon of that side needs to reach the square (multi-source BFS from all its amazons; '-' = unreachable).\nBlue: White is closer (32 squares).  Red: Black is closer (24 squares).  Grey: same distance (no owner).\nterritory = 32 - 24 = 8     mobility = 45 - 35 = 10\nevaluate(state, WHITE) = W1 * territory + W2 * mobility = 1.0 * 8 + 0.2 * 10 = 10",
   "originalText": "Each number is the least number of queen moves an amazon of that side needs to reach the square (multi-source BFS from all its amazons; '-' = unreachable).\nBlue: White is closer (32 squares).  Red: Black is closer (24 squares).  Grey: same distance (no owner).\nterritory = 32 - 24 = 8     mobility = 45 - 35 = 10\nevaluate(state, WHITE) = W1 * territory + W2 * mobility = 1.0 * 8 + 0.2 * 10 = 10",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "ryvoubi2etcmfvwm",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
